DESCRIPTION:ime series analysis is vital for trends and forecasting in fina
 nce and healthcare. This talk explores ARIMA models for clustering disease
  data in 48 European countries\, using Python libraries like pmdarima and 
 TimeSeriesSplit. We’ll examine how distance measures like Piccolo\, Maha
 raj\, and LPC reveal health disparities\, showcasing how Python enhances p
 ublic health surveillance and interventions.
